{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" initial=\"a\">\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <transition/>\n    <transition event=\"go\" target=\"b\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"b\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml004-inert-transition.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml004-inert-transition.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":0,"byteOffset":106,"endColumn":16,"endLine":3,"startColumn":16,"startLine":3},"insertedContent":{"text":" event=\"…\""}}]}],"description":{"text":"add the event that triggers the transition"},"properties":{"applicability":"has-placeholders"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml004-inert-transition.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":16,"endLine":3,"startColumn":6,"startLine":3}}}],"message":{"markdown":"transition must have at least one of `event`, `cond`, or `target`\n\n**Note:** SCXML 1.0 §3.5.2: \"A conformant SCXML document MUST specify at least one of 'event', 'cond' or 'target'.\" Executable content alone does not count: such a transition is enabled in every microstep and never changes the configuration, so the macrostep would never complete\n\n**Help:** add the event that triggers it, a condition, or the target state\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.5 <transition>","text":"transition must have at least one of `event`, `cond`, or `target`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":106,"start":96},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"SCXML004"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"SCXML 1.0 §3.5.2: \"A conformant SCXML document MUST specify at least one of 'event', 'cond' or 'target'.\" Executable content alone does not count: such a transition is enabled in every microstep and never changes the configuration, so the macrostep would never complete"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: add an `event` trigger, a `cond` guard, or a `target`, or delete the transition.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §3.5 <transition>\n\nRun `scx --explain SCXML004` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#transition","id":"SCXML004","name":"SCXML004","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a transition has no event, condition, or target"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}